{"id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:function-bochner-formula","title":"lem:function-bochner-formula","path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.md","line":920,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex#lem:function-bochner-formula","uses":["[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:ricci-curvature]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#lem:hessian-symmetric]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:gradient-norm-sq-gradient]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:second-covariant-derivative-vector-field]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#lem:ricci-commutation-vector-field]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#lem:ricci-trace-curvature-operator]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:hessian-riesz-trace]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:laplacian-trace-commutation]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:hessian-norm-sq]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex","label":"lem:function-bochner-formula","line":1401,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[Bochner formula for functions]\n\\label{lem:function-bochner-formula}\n\n\\uses{def:ricci-curvature}\n\n\n\n\nFor smooth $f$,\n$$\\frac12\\Delta|\\nabla f|^2\n=|\\Hess(f)|^2\n+\\langle(\\nabla f)^*,(\\nabla\\Delta f)^*\\rangle\n+\\Ric((\\nabla f)^*,(\\nabla f)^*).$$\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch\n\\uses{lem:hessian-symmetric,lem:gradient-norm-sq-gradient,def:second-covariant-derivative-vector-field,lem:ricci-commutation-vector-field,lem:ricci-trace-curvature-operator,lem:hessian-riesz-trace,lem:laplacian-trace-commutation,def:hessian-norm-sq,def:ricci-curvature}\n\nSet $G=(\\nabla f)^*$ and trace\n$\\Hess(|\\nabla f|^2)(X,Y)=2\\langle\\nabla_X\\nabla_GG,Y\\rangle$.\nDecompose\n$$\\nabla_{E_i}\\nabla_GG\n=\\nabla^2G(G,E_i)+\\mathcal R(E_i,G)G\n+\\nabla_{\\nabla_{E_i}G}G.$$\nThe three traces are respectively\n$G(\\Delta f)$, $\\Ric(G,G)$, and $|\\Hess(f)|^2$ by the preceding\nlemmas.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[Bochner formula for functions] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a66756e6374696f6e2d626f63686e65722d666f726d756c61\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23def%3Aricci-curvature\">↗ def:ricci-curvature</a> <p></p>For smooth <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f$\">$f$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[ \\frac12\\Delta |\\nabla f|^2 =|\\Hess (f)|^2 +\\langle (\\nabla f)^*,(\\nabla \\Delta f)^*\\rangle +\\Ric ((\\nabla f)^*,(\\nabla f)^*). \\]\">\\[ \\frac12\\Delta |\\nabla f|^2 =|\\Hess (f)|^2 +\\langle (\\nabla f)^*,(\\nabla \\Delta f)^*\\rangle +\\Ric ((\\nabla f)^*,(\\nabla f)^*). \\]</span>  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23lem%3Ahessian-symmetric\">↗ lem:hessian-symmetric</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Agradient-norm-sq-gradient\">↗ lem:gradient-norm-sq-gradient</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23def%3Asecond-covariant-derivative-vector-field\">↗ def:second-covariant-derivative-vector-field</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23lem%3Aricci-commutation-vector-field\">↗ lem:ricci-commutation-vector-field</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23lem%3Aricci-trace-curvature-operator\">↗ lem:ricci-trace-curvature-operator</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Ahessian-riesz-trace\">↗ lem:hessian-riesz-trace</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Alaplacian-trace-commutation\">↗ lem:laplacian-trace-commutation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23def%3Ahessian-norm-sq\">↗ def:hessian-norm-sq</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23def%3Aricci-curvature\">↗ def:ricci-curvature</a> </p><p>Set <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$G=(\\nabla f)^*$\">$G=(\\nabla f)^*$</span> and trace <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\Hess (|\\nabla f|^2)(X,Y)=2\\langle \\nabla _X\\nabla _GG,Y\\rangle $\">$\\Hess (|\\nabla f|^2)(X,Y)=2\\langle \\nabla _X\\nabla _GG,Y\\rangle $</span>. Decompose </p><p><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[ \\nabla _{E_i}\\nabla _GG =\\nabla ^2G(G,E_i)+\\mathcal R(E_i,G)G +\\nabla _{\\nabla _{E_i}G}G. \\]\">\\[ \\nabla _{E_i}\\nabla _GG =\\nabla ^2G(G,E_i)+\\mathcal R(E_i,G)G +\\nabla _{\\nabla _{E_i}G}G. \\]</span></p><p> The three traces are respectively <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$G(\\Delta f)$\">$G(\\Delta f)$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\Ric (G,G)$\">$\\Ric (G,G)$</span>, and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$|\\Hess (f)|^2$\">$|\\Hess (f)|^2$</span> by the preceding lemmas. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:laplacian-square-norm-one-form","next":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#cor:bochner-vanishing","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:ricci-curvature","title":"def:ricci-curvature","label":"def:ricci-curvature"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#lem:hessian-symmetric","title":"lem:hessian-symmetric","label":"lem:hessian-symmetric"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:gradient-norm-sq-gradient","title":"lem:gradient-norm-sq-gradient","label":"lem:gradient-norm-sq-gradient"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:second-covariant-derivative-vector-field","title":"def:second-covariant-derivative-vector-field","label":"def:second-covariant-derivative-vector-field"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#lem:ricci-commutation-vector-field","title":"lem:ricci-commutation-vector-field","label":"lem:ricci-commutation-vector-field"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#lem:ricci-trace-curvature-operator","title":"lem:ricci-trace-curvature-operator","label":"lem:ricci-trace-curvature-operator"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:hessian-riesz-trace","title":"lem:hessian-riesz-trace","label":"lem:hessian-riesz-trace"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:laplacian-trace-commutation","title":"lem:laplacian-trace-commutation","label":"lem:laplacian-trace-commutation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:hessian-norm-sq","title":"def:hessian-norm-sq","label":"def:hessian-norm-sq"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#cor:bochner-vanishing","title":"cor:bochner-vanishing","label":"cor:bochner-vanishing"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#line","title":"line","label":"line"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:function-bochner-formula","title":"lem:function-bochner-formula","tex":"\\begin{lemma}[Bochner formula for functions]\n\\label{lem:function-bochner-formula}\n\n\\uses{def:ricci-curvature}\n\n\n\n\nFor smooth $f$,\n$$\\frac12\\Delta|\\nabla f|^2\n=|\\Hess(f)|^2\n+\\langle(\\nabla f)^*,(\\nabla\\Delta f)^*\\rangle\n+\\Ric((\\nabla f)^*,(\\nabla f)^*).$$\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch\n\\uses{lem:hessian-symmetric,lem:gradient-norm-sq-gradient,def:second-covariant-derivative-vector-field,lem:ricci-commutation-vector-field,lem:ricci-trace-curvature-operator,lem:hessian-riesz-trace,lem:laplacian-trace-commutation,def:hessian-norm-sq,def:ricci-curvature}\n\nSet $G=(\\nabla f)^*$ and trace\n$\\Hess(|\\nabla f|^2)(X,Y)=2\\langle\\nabla_X\\nabla_GG,Y\\rangle$.\nDecompose\n$$\\nabla_{E_i}\\nabla_GG\n=\\nabla^2G(G,E_i)+\\mathcal R(E_i,G)G\n+\\nabla_{\\nabla_{E_i}G}G.$$\nThe three traces are respectively\n$G(\\Delta f)$, $\\Ric(G,G)$, and $|\\Hess(f)|^2$ by the preceding\nlemmas.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/